    Source: packages/compose-gen/specs/organisms/number-field.json
    A narrow number field between a minus and a plus ghost icon button, drawn as one control (4px inside its ring). Static markup: the buttons carry no logic; the page wires them.
    Props (p): value, name, min, label, decrease, increase. -#}
{%- set v_value = og_def(p['value'], '') -%}
{%- set v_name = og_def(p['name'], '') -%}
